{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund improvements to local parks, particularly for children with SEN",
        "additional_details": "We think our local parks should be a place where every child feels welcome, safe, and included. Unfortunately, we feel the current facilities don\u2019t meet the needs of many children, especially those with Special Educational Needs (SEN) and disabilities.",
        "background": "Fund:\r\n* Inclusive and accessible play equipment for children of all abilities\r\n* Sensory play areas designed for autistic and SEN children\r\n* Safe, secure fencing where appropriate\r\n* Better-maintained equipment and play surfaces\r\n* More seating, shaded areas, and accessible pathways for families",
